### List the entries — newest first (BR-04)
GET {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries

### Add an entry
# @name add
POST {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Anna",
  "message": "Good morning!"
}

### One entry — the identifier from the response above
GET {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries/{{add.response.body.id}}

### Amend the message — created_at does not move (BR-02)
PATCH {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries/{{add.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "An amended message"
}

### Delete — permanent (BR-03), answers 204 with no body
DELETE {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries/{{add.response.body.id}}

### Refusal: an empty signature after trimming — 422 (BR-01)
POST {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "   ",
  "message": "anything"
}

### Refusal: a PATCH with no field at all — 422, code guestbook_entry_empty_patch
PATCH {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Refusal: an unknown entry — 404, code guestbook_entry_not_found
GET {{host}}/api/guestbook-entries/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
